DESCRIPTION:Come to Collective Arts for a lineup jam packed of some of th
 e best emerging Canadian rock bands. Scummm are sexier than ever and now 
 with sax! Tire Fire travels from Goderich\, Ontario to burn up the stage.
  Newcomers\, S.T.U.D will rock their second show and Junk Mail will open 
 the night with an intimate performance. Come get fuzzed out and we’ll see
  you in the pit! 🍑\n\n\nBRING A TIN! We're collecting donations for Toro
 nto food bank\, The Lighthouse Centre. Donations of non-perishable food w
 ill enter you a chance to win some free drinks!
