SUMMARY: Total Assault on Culture! FUGS FILM + NOVA '78: DOUBLE FEATURE
DESCRIPTION:Two films\, one afternoon of radical music\, art and New York
  counterculture.\n\nFilms We Like presents a special double feature of FU
 GS FILM and NOVA '78 at Paradise Theatre on November 28\, featuring two Q
 &As with film critic Jason Gorber.\n\nFUGS FILM\, directed by Chuck Smith
 \, chronicles The Fugs\, the legendary 1960s underground rock band whose 
 provocative music fused poetry\, politics and anti-establishment rebellio
 n.\n\nNOVA '78\, directed by Aaron Brookner and Rodrigo Areias\, transpor
 ts audiences to the legendary 1978 Nova Convention in New York City. Buil
 t from rediscovered archival footage\, the film captures a remarkable gat
 hering of countercultural icons including William S. Burroughs\, Patti Sm
 ith\, Frank Zappa\, Allen Ginsberg and Laurie Anderson.\n\nJoin us for an
  afternoon celebrating the artists\, musicians and troublemakers who help
 ed reshape American culture.
CATEGORIES:Film,Punk-Rock-Music,Paradise-Theatre
