SUMMARY: ART OPEN STUDIO - FLICK THE SWITCH GRANGE LOCATION
DESCRIPTION:EXPLORE THE BEHIND-THE-SCENES OF ARTISTS’ CREATIVE PROCESSES\
 n\nEver wondered what goes on behind the studio doors? Now’s your chance 
 to find out!\n\nPlease join us for an afternoon of creativity\, curiosity
 \, and a little artistic chaos at Flick the Switch’s Open Studio at The G
 range! Meet around 30 talented artists working across an exciting mix of 
 mediums\, from stained glass to painting to fabric art\, installations\, 
 and everything in between. Get a peek into their creative processes\, dis
 cover works in progress\, explore unique artistic spaces\, and see firsth
 and what happens when imagination takes over.\n\nStep inside our beautifu
 l 4-floor downtown collective that feels more like a European retreat. Th
 is is your invitation to wander\, explore\, chat with artists\, and exper
 ience the creative energy that makes Flick the Switch special. And if you
 're getting a head start on holiday shopping\, you're in luck! A selectio
 n of original artworks and handmade pieces will be available for purchase
  at great prices. Skip the predictable presents this year and find someth
 ing truly one of a kind.\n\nWhether you're an art enthusiast\, a curious 
 passerby\, or someone who just wants to see what artists get up to when t
 hey're not making magic in public\, there's something here for you.\n\nNo
  ticket required. Just bring your curiosity and positive energy!\n\n📅 Sa
 turday\, November 28\, 2026\n🕐 1:00 PM – 5:00 PM\n📍 Flick the Switch - 
 The Grange Location (34 Stephanie Street\, Toronto)\n\nCome for the art\,
  stay for the inspiration\, and leave with something one-of-a-kind!\n\n\n
 Flick the Switch is a vibrant creative community and collaborative studio
  space in downtown Toronto\, bringing together artists working across a w
 ide range of disciplines and mediums. From stained glass and painting to 
 textile arts\, sculpture\, and experimental installations\, the studio pr
 ovides a space for artists to create\, experiment\, collaborate\, and sha
 re their work.\n\nLocated at two locations in the heart of downtown Toron
 to\, Flick the Switch celebrates artistic exploration\, creative exchange
 \, and the process behind the finished piece. Through exhibitions\, studi
 o events\, and community initiatives\, it aims to make art more accessibl
 e while connecting artists with one another and the wider public.\n\nFoll
 ow us on Instagram @flicktheswitchart to stay updated!
CATEGORIES:Art-Show/Gallery-Event,Flick-the-Switch,Market
