DESCRIPTION:Join us on Sunday\, November 29\, 2026\, from 12pm–5pm for a 
 warm\, welcoming afternoon filled with original artwork\, unique handmade
  goods\, and friendly conversations with creators from across the Akin co
 mmunity. Featuring 14 talented artists and makers working across ceramics
 \, painting\, illustration\, crafts\, and more\, this market is a lovely 
 opportunity to find unique pieces to add to your artisanal collection and
  support local artists directly.\n\nFree to attend. Everyone is welcome.\
 n\nFeaturing: Anya Bess (@anyabess.art mailto:(@anyabess.art )\, Art & Al
 chemy Parfum (@artandalchemyparfum)\, Behrang Doosti (@behrangdoosti)\, B
