SUMMARY: Beginner linocut printmaking workshop
DESCRIPTION:Get into the holiday spirit with a creative afternoon of lino
 cut printmaking! In this beginner-friendly workshop\, you'll learn the ba
 sics of carving\, inking\, and printing using traditional linocut techniq
 ues to create your own unique holiday cards.\n\nNo previous experience is
  needed. Explore your creativity\, experiment with patterns and designs\,
  and leave with a collection of handmade cards to share with friends and 
 family!\n\nBring a friend with you and each will get $5 off!
