DESCRIPTION:Humans First Experience 002 brings together music\, visual ar
 t\, creativity and community for an afternoon at OBJX Studios in Toronto.
  Featuring a multi-genre live performance\, local artists\, tattoo activa
 tions\, complimentary coffee\, drinks and snacks\, and raffles\, the even
 t is centred around connection and shared experiences. Giving back is als
 o a big part of the experience\, with a portion of event proceeds and 100
 % of funds raised through raffle ticket sales going towards the Let's Cur
 e Lucas Foundation to support Lucas and his family.\n\n\nTickets for the 
 event can be purchased using this link: humans-first.bloomtickets.ca/even
 t/4388 https://humans-first.bloomtickets.ca/event/4388
