 r a late check-out and reset your week at Wiggle Room at the Industry Wee
 kly Social.\n\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\n\n\nEvery fu
 nky Sunday funday\, at your service!\nwith Toronto's finest: MANZONE & ST
 RONG https://on.soundcloud.com/yjJCoMeTijpVkmAEA and the Wiggly family.\n
