SUMMARY: High Notes Avante - Candles and Crescendos
DESCRIPTION:An acclaimed tenor\, a Toronto Argonauts quarterback and a po
 werful cause unite for an unforgettable evening of music in Yorkville.\n\
 nOn Thursday\, December 3\, High Notes Avante presents Candles & Crescend
 os: An Evening to Brighten Lives at Toronto's historic Heliconian Hall\, 
 celebrating the charity's mission to make music accessible to people affe
 cted by mental health challenges.\n\nThe intimate fundraising evening fea
 tures internationally acclaimed tenor Ernesto Ramírez and special guest T
 oronto Argonauts quarterback Chad Kelly\, who will share why the Chad Kel
 ly Foundation has chosen to support High Notes Avante.\n\nGuests will enj
 oy live performances\, food and drinks\, a silent auction and a special c
 andlelit musical moment\, all in support of the High Notes Music Program.
 \n\n
