SUMMARY: CBC Holiday Mixtape\, a special Make The Season Kind concert cel
 ebration for Daily Bread Food Bank
DESCRIPTION:CBC Holiday Mixtape\, a special Make the Season Kind live-con
 cert event! http://cbc.ca/kind\n\nGet ready to turn up the holiday spirit
  at the CBC Holiday Mixtape! http://cbc.ca/kind Join CBC to Make the Seas
 on Kind at a one-night-only live music celebration featuring headliners T
 he Strumbellas and Tenille Townes\, alongside Haviah Mighty\, Preston Pab
 lo\, Sofia Camara\, Aqyila\, Sebastian Gaskin and Elysia Biro. Expect art
 ists from across genres performing their own hits and putting their uniqu
 e spin on holiday favourites. The CBC Toronto Broadcast Centre will trans
 form into a winter wonderland\, complete with festive food and drinks\, a
  winter portrait studio\, and more. Hosted by CBC’s Angeline Tetteh-Wayoe
  and Odario Williams\, it’s a holiday party with a purpose. Tickets are $
 10 with 100% of proceeds supporting Daily Bread Food Bank and more opport
 unities for monetary donations to Daily Bread Food Bank at the event.\n\n
 \nWhen - Friday\, December 4\, 2026.\n\n6:30 PM Doors Open\, 7:30 PM Conc
 ert Starts\n\nWhere - CBC Toronto Broadcast Centre\, 250 Front St. West\,
  Toronto.\n\n\nPlease note that this is a 19+ event and an open-floor & s
 tanding-room experience.\n\nFor more inquiries or if you require accommod
 ations\, please email us at rsvp@cbc.ca mailto:rsvp@cbc.ca .\n\nCheck out
  - cbc.ca/kind http://cbc.ca/kind\n\nhttps://www.cbc.ca/kind/ https://www
 .cbc.ca/kind/\n\nBuy tickets - https://CBCHolidayMixtape.eventbrite.com h
 ttps://cbcholidaymixtape.eventbrite.com/\n\n
CATEGORIES:Concert,CBC-Toronto-Broadcast-Centre
