 sons of Advent to Epiphany with a wide range of music and readings for th
 e season. We feature the motets\, carols\, and hymns of such composers as
  Byrd\, Lauridsen\, Mouton\, Vaughan Williams\, and Willan\, along with r
 eadings by such authors as John Donne\, Christina Rosetti\, and T.S. Elli
 ott.\n\nTickets: $35\, $30 (seniors) and $15 (students with ID)\n\nSt. Pa
 trick's Catholic Church 137 McCaul St.\, Toronto
