SUMMARY: BEATLES NIGHT AT THE RIVOLI w/ The Young Scones / Pest. / Black 
 Paint / Propter Hawk
DESCRIPTION:Four Toronto bands take on the Fab Four! A night of Beatles c
 lassics\, deep cuts and psychedelic gems\, live at the Rivoli on December
  18th.\n\nEach band will bring their own sound and style to the Beatles c
 atalogue\, taking on everything from the early rock ’n’ roll numbers to t
 he psychedelic experiments\, hidden gems and timeless classics.\n\nNo tri
 bute acts\, no impersonations — just four great local bands putting their
  own spin on some of the greatest songs ever written.\n\nExpect loud guit
