SUMMARY: Sunday SerVice: Wiggly's Annual Holiday Toy Drive + Bring Your K
 ids To The Rave
DESCRIPTION:Thank Goodness It's Sunday :)\n\n\nWIGGLY'S ANNUAL HOLIDAY PA
 RTY & TOY DRIVE!\n\nBRING A TOY\, SPREAD SOME JOY\, AND GET WIGGLY!\n\nIt
 's that magical time of year again when the Wiggly family comes together 
 to celebrate the holidays\, give back to our community\, and dance the ni
 ght away!\n\nEvery year\, our amazing community collects more toys than t
 he year before\, and this year we're determined to SMASH LAST YEAR'S RECO
 RD!\n\nThis year we partnered up with our friends at the Red Door Family 
 Shelter. All toys collected will be donated to Red Door Family Shelter\, 
 helping organize birthday parties for children living in local shelters. 
 Let's make sure every child gets to feel special on their birthday!\n\n6 
 PM – 10 PM | FAMILY HOLIDAY FUN!\n\nBring the little Wigglers! Kids are w
 elcome with a parent or guardian. Enjoy special holiday mocktails\, festi
 ve cheer\, and rumour has it... SANTA might even make an appearance!\n\n1
 0 PM – EARLY MONDAY MORNING | LET'S GET WIGGLY!\n\nOnce the little ones h
 ead home\, the party kicks into high gear with BOUNCY BEATS\, holiday mis
 chief\, and a dance floor full of Wiggly love!\n\nBOUNCY BEATS TILL EARLY
  MONDAY MORNING!\n\n\nPut on your Sunday best\, sip your tips\, or ride t
 hat bender. Join us for a late check-out and reset your week at Wiggle Ro
 om at the Industry Weekly Social.\n\n\nEvery funky Sunday funday\, at you
 r service!\nwith Toronto's finest: MANZONE & STRONG https://on.soundcloud
 .com/yjJCoMeTijpVkmAEA and the Wiggly family.\nCOMPLIMENTARY Entry before
  10pm with RSVP\nOpen at 6 pm ~ $6 Vodka & Beer specials before 11pm\n+ W
 ellness Cabin by Sacred Hands\n\nit's a Sunday thang...\n\nSun Dec 20: Mi
 ke "Agent X" Clark [Detroit] | Manzone & Strong | Tyler Hill | Amir Nian 
 | Jay Force | 3ROC\n\nRSVP & Advance Tickets:\nDo You Know Who I Am? (FRE
 E Entry before 10pm)\nThe Wiggler: $23\n\nPerformers:\n6-7 Louise Nox\n7-
 8 Queen GaGa\n8-9 Barroness\n9-10:30 Wiley Coyote & Dick Diamonds\n10:30-
 12 Paolo & Nikki Atana\n12-1 TAKiN\n1-2 Tyler Hill\n2-close Manzone & Str
 ong\nVJ Amir Nian\n\nTo Arrange Special Packages & Table Reservations - w
 igglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com (sold separately from
  admission)\n\nATM on site\nFull Bar Service\n19+ event\n\nhosted by: Tor
 onto House Community / Wiggly Events / Manzone & Strong / Wiggle Room Tor
 onto\n\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code of conduct and rese
 rve the right to refuse anyone at any time. Wiggle Room is a Safer Dance 
 Space. We take this very seriously. We encourage everyone not to hesitate
  to bring to our attention anything you think that we should be made awar
 e of\, such as harassment\, violation of personal space\, solicitation or
  use of controlled substances\, over-intoxicated behaviour\, or anything 
 else that may pose a risk or discomfort to you or others. You may use the
  safe word BANANA\, ask any of our staff for a Banana\, and we will direc
 t you to a safe\, quiet space. Our security staff are in marked clothing.
  Our team and event hosts\, such as Takin\, Lindsay Fay\, Tyler Hill\, DT
 M (coat check)\, and Monique (bar) are all available.\n\n~ Wiggle Wiggle 
 ~\n772 Dundas St West\n\n\n
CATEGORIES:DJ/Club/Rave,Wiggle-Room
