 \n\nWalking in My Shoes\n\nIt's No Good\n\nDream On\n\nPrecious\n\nGhosts
  Again\n\n... and many more!\n\n\nFREE - RSVP: www.eventbrite.ca/e/200118
 6627072?aff=oddtdtcreator https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/2001186627072?aff=o
 ddtdtcreator\n\n
