SUMMARY: NYE + Afterparty | 9pm-7am
DESCRIPTION:New Years Eve + Afterparty\n9pm-7am\n\n\nFeaturing some of Wi
 ggle Room's Resident DJs\nManzone & Strong | TAKiN | Miz Megs | Tyler Hil
 l | Barroness | RandomDoug | Nour | Sub.Text (formarly known as Bigfoot)\
 n\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com/event/nye-afterparty-
 9pm-7am/\nTier 1: $45\nTier 2: $55\nTier 3: $65\nTier 4: $75\nFinal Tier:
  $85\nAFTERPARTY Only (After 2:30am Arrival): $45\n+ add Personal Champag
 ne in advance at a reduced price of $15 each (200mL)\n\nWiggle Room:\n9-1
 1pm - NOUR (Bouncy House)\n11-midnight: TAKiN (Tribal & Tech House)\nmidn
 ight-2am: MANZONE & STRONG (Tribal & Tech House)\n2-3am: Miz Megs (Bouncy
  Tech House)\n3-4am: Tyler Hill (Dirty Minimal & Bass House)\n4-5am: Rand
 omDoug (Bouncy Tech House)\n5-6am: Sub.Text (Bouncy House)\n6-7am: Barron
 ess (Bouncy Dirty Tech House)\n+VJ Amir Nian\n\nOptions for prepaid table
