 kage: $1200\nincludes: 6 General Admissions\; 2 Premium Bottles of Choice
  (email wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com to specify c
 hoice)\n\nTo Arrange Special Packages - wigglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wig
 glyevents@gmail.com (sold separately of admission)\n\nATM on site\nFull B
 ar Service\n21+ event\n\nhosted by: Wiggly Events\; OG Entertainment\; Su
 nshine Frequencies\; and Wiggle Room Toronto\n\n\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\
 nWe have a strict code of conduct and reserve the right to refuse anyone 
