DESCRIPTION:Sat Jan 2: DAVID HERRERO [Spain]\nJunior Lopez | Paolo | Mela
 nie Sutherland | 3ROC\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com/e
 vent/tribal-bounce-david-herrero-spain/\nEarly Wiggler: $20\nThe Wiggler:
  $25\n\nWe're kicking off 2027 with a TRIBAL & BOUNCE explosion as Spanis
 h house music legend DAVID HERRERO takes over Wiggle Room on January 2!\n
 \nA true veteran of the global house music scene\, with massive releases 
 on InStereo\, Nervous\, Rawthentic\, and Wiggle Room Records\, Herrero br
 ings decades of dancefloor mastery to the decks!\n\nFirst Wiggly party of
  2027 — let's start the year with a BANG!\n\nAdvance Tickets:\nEarly Wigg
 ler: $20\nThe Wiggler: $25\n\nPerformances:\n10-12 Paolo & Melanie Suther
 land\n12-1 Junior Lopez\n1-4 DAVID HERRERO\n4-close 3ROC\n\n\n#WiggleRoom
 Toronto is the #HomeofBouncyBeats\nOptions for prepaid table/ticket packa
 ges (ONE ticket = everything mentioned) - To Arrange Special Packages: wi
 gglyevents@gmail.com mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com (sold separately from 
 admission)\n\nATM on site\nFull Bar Service\n21+ event\n\nHosted by: 1lvl
 1 Entertainment\; Wiggly Events\; Wiggle Room Toronto\; Sunshine Frequenc
 ies\n\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSIBLY ~\nWe have a strict code of conduct and reser
 ve the right to refuse anyone at any time. Wiggle Room is a Safer Dance S
 pace. We take this very seriously. We encourage everyone not to hesitate 
 to bring to our attention anything you think that we should be made aware
  of\, such as harassment\, violation of personal space\, solicitation or 
 use of controlled substances\, over-intoxicated behaviour\, or anything e
 lse that may pose a risk or discomfort to you or others. You may use the 
 safe word BANANA\, ask any of our staff for a Banana\, and we will direct
  you to a safe\, quiet space. Our security staff are in marked clothing. 
 Our team and event hosts\, such as Takin\, Lindsay Fay\, Nour Bawab\, Chr
 istina Barron\, Tyler Hill\, Mitch (lead security)\, and Tanya\, are all 
 available.\n\n~ Wiggle Wiggle ~\n772 Dundas St West
