SUMMARY: We Need To Talk - Comedy Show
DESCRIPTION:Following the wildly popular success of his first two Canada-
 wide tours\, “Don’t Lie...You Were Thinking It Too!” and “Nargis’ Son\,” 
 Zul Gulamhusein is back with his brand-new third tour\, “We Need to Talk”
 . Expanding beyond Canada and venturing into the U.S.\, Zul brings his si
 gnature storytelling\, sharp wit\, and unapologetically honest humour to 
 a whole new collection of hilarious observations about life.\n\nFrom navi
 gating the unexpected chaos of parenthood and accepting that he's no long
 er the thug he once thought he was\, to figuring out matrimonial responsi
 bilities\, surviving the expectations of an immigrant upbringing\, and re
 alizing that getting older comes with more aches\, responsibilities\, and
  significantly less patience\, nothing is off limits.\n\nAnd\, of course\
 , he's still finding creative ways to wish minor inconveniences on people
  who get on his nerves — because apparently\, maturity doesn't mean letti
 ng things go. “We Need to Talk” is a hilarious\, relatable and brutally h
 onest look at growing up\, growing older\, and realizing that life didn't
  exactly turn out the way you planned.\n\nOne thing's for sure: after thi
 s show\, you'll have a few things to talk about!
CATEGORIES:Comedy
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/6755f3e6a02aaf
 1c2599e757/6b06470c969ef8999459d5cc/scaled_1024.jpg
