DESCRIPTION:Sat Feb 6: Good Times Gang: SHINNENKAI\nBaker | Ms Melony J |
  Nour | Erno | Scott Hensberger\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtor
 onto.com/event/good-times-gang-shinnenkai/\nEarly Wiggler: $20\nThe Wiggl
 er: $25\n\n10 YEARS OF SHINNENKAI! - The Good Times Gang is back with the
 ir 10th Annual SHINNENKAI celebration! A decade of unforgettable memories
 \, incredible music\, and bringing good people together for great times. 
 Join the crew as we kick off the new year in true Good Times Gang style —
  bigger\, bouncier\, and better than ever!\n\nPerformances:\n10-11 Scott 
 Hensberger\n11-12:30 Ms Melony J\n12:30-2 Erno\n2-3:30 BAKER\n3:30-close 
 Nour\nCustom lighing by Chris Harrison\n\n#WiggleRoomToronto is the #Home
 ofBouncyBeats\nOptions for prepaid table/ticket packages (ONE ticket = ev
 erything mentioned) - To Arrange Special Packages: wigglyevents@gmail.com
  mailto:wigglyevents@gmail.com (sold separately from admission)\n\nATM on
  site\nFull Bar Service\n21+ event\n\nHosted by: Good Times Gang\; Wiggly
  Events\; Wiggle Room Toronto\; Sunshine Frequencies\n\n~ WiGGLE RESPONSI
 BLY ~\nWe have a strict code of conduct and reserve the right to refuse a
 nyone at any time. Wiggle Room is a Safer Dance Space. We take this very 
 seriously. We encourage everyone not to hesitate to bring to our attentio
 n anything you think that we should be made aware of\, such as harassment
 \, violation of personal space\, solicitation or use of controlled substa
 nces\, over-intoxicated behaviour\, or anything else that may pose a risk
  or discomfort to you or others. You may use the safe word BANANA\, ask a
 ny of our staff for a Banana\, and we will direct you to a safe\, quiet s
 pace. Our security staff are in marked clothing. Our team and event hosts
 \, such as Takin\, Lindsay Fay\, Nour Bawab\, Christina Barron\, Tyler Hi
 ll\, Mitch (lead security)\, and Tanya\, are all available.\n\n~ Wiggle W
 iggle ~\n772 Dundas St West
