SUMMARY: Prince - 11 years of purple tears - A Prince Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Prince Rogers Nelson — the Purple One\, the Genius of Paisley
  Park\, the man who could make a guitar weep and a crowd lose their minds
  with a single glance — left this world exactly 11 years ago this week.\n
 \nOn the 11th anniversary of his heartbreaking departure\, we gather not 
 to mourn\, but to celebrate the immortal fire he lit in all of us.\n\n\nC
 ome honor his unparalleled life.\nCome rejoice in his revolutionary caree
 r.\n\n\nCome feel the thunder of his impact — the way he shattered bounda
 ries\, rewrote the rules of music\, fashion\, sexuality\, and freedom its
 elf.\n\n\nCome stand in awe of the unstoppable legacy that still echoes t
 hrough every stage\, every playlist\, and every bold soul brave enough to
  be unapologetically themselves. This is Prince.\n\n\nThis is forever. Le
 t’s make the 11th anniversary a celebration worthy of the legend.\n#Princ
 e11Forever\n\n\n\n\nWe'll celebrate everything Prince in Toronto's Corso 
 Italia neighbourhood.\n\n\n****FREE!***\n\n\nAll Prince\, all night 7pm t
 o past midnight. Come celebrate with other fans. St. Clair West just off 
 Dufferin.\n\n\n\nBIG Audio - an amazing presentation\n\n\nBIG Video - on 
 8 HUGE screens\n\nHOURLY Prince door prizes - unique gifts you will love\
 n\nFUN food and drink specials - purple treats\n\n\nAll Prince's biggest 
 hits for 4+ straight hours\, with a room full of other fans. A multi-scre
 en video presentation with most video hits in original formats\, with sid
 e screens with unique Prince footage.\n\n\n****FREE!***\n\n\nPlease note 
 - this is a tribute night featuring licensed audio and video. No live ban
 d or artist appearance or performance is planned or anticipated.\n\n\nMAI
 N Video LIST\n\n\n1999\n\nBatdance\n\nCall My Name\n\nGlam Slam\n\nI Wann
 a Be Your Lover\n\nLet’s Pretend We’re Married\n\nLittle Red Corvette\n\n
 New Power Generation\n\nNothing Compares To U\n\nScandalous\n\nShe’s Alwa
 ys In My Hair\n\nTake Me With You\n\nThe Greatest Romance Ever Sold\n\nTh
 e Most Beautiful Girl In The World\n\nThe Question Of You\n\nU Got The Lo
 ok\n\n7\n\nCream\n\nDiamonds\n\nGett Off\n\nSexy M. F.\n\nAnotherloverhol
 enyohead\n\nKiss\n\nLet’s Go Crazy\n\nPaisley Park\n\nRaspberry Beret\n\n
 When Doves Cry\n\n\nLIVE videos\n\n\nBaby I’m A Star\n\nCream\n\nI Would 
 Die 4 U\n\nKiss\n\nMusicology\n\nNothing Compares To U\n\nPurple Rain\n\n
 Take Me With U\n\n\nOther artists perform Prince-written songs\n\n\nSugar
  Walls (Sheena Easton)\n\nI Feel For You (Chaka Khan)\n\nThe Glamorous Li
 fe (Sheila E.)\n\nManic Monday (The Bangles)\n\n\n\n\nFREE - RSVP for fre
 e tickets right HERE on Eventbrite https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/1988215537
 193?aff=oddtdtcreator .
CATEGORIES:DJ/Club/Rave,Listening-Party,Cat's-Cradle
